WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:05.230
Aw, dude. Now I'm
all covered in soup!

3
00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.310
Well, it ain't fit
for eating, is it?

4
00:00:07.310 --> 00:00:10.480
Why not wear it? [laughs]

5
00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:14.820
Bring out another barrelful!
We'll have a food fight!

6
00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:17.150
[BEAST PIRATE AG]
Pour some over here!

7
00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:20.930
[Beast Pirates laughing]

8
00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:21.790
[Luffy grunts]

9
00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:24.970
There's plenty of food here.

10
00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:28.100
No reason for anyone
in Wano to go hungry.

11
00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:31.440
So why do you idiots
have all of it?

12
00:02:05.280 --> 00:02:11.950
[Beast Pirates gasp]

13
00:02:05.770 --> 00:02:07.940
<b>Battle Music</b>

14
00:02:11.950 --> 00:02:17.210
[sighs]

15
00:02:17.210 --> 00:02:19.000
This guy is a freak!

16
00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:25.880
He's really into
that soup. Kinda weird.

17
00:02:26.380 --> 00:02:27.720
[sighs]

18
00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:30.260
Yeah. It's damn good.

19
00:02:30.260 --> 00:02:33.100
Nothing in the whole world
tastes as sweet as this.

20
00:02:33.100 --> 00:02:34.680
[Beast Pirates gasp]

21
00:02:40.830 --> 00:02:42.540
[LUFFY]
You don't even want this.

22
00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:46.800
Why do you get to have it
while Tama goes hungry?!

23
00:02:48.760 --> 00:02:52.550
[yells]

24
00:03:25.590 --> 00:03:28.390
[Beast Pirates gasping]

25
00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:38.110
Hm?

26
00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:44.490
Damn Straw Hat.

27
00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:47.510
The moron can't even
follow his own plan!

28
00:03:47.510 --> 00:03:49.600
[WIRE]
I thought we were
avoiding fights.

29
00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:52.980
Isn't that the whole reason
why we're wearing disguises?

30
00:03:52.980 --> 00:03:54.810
[KID]
Whatever.

31
00:03:54.810 --> 00:03:54.940
Let him be!

32
00:03:54.940 --> 00:03:56.270
[KILLER]
Kid?

33
00:03:57.440 --> 00:03:59.780
If the idiot wants
to make a scene,

34
00:03:59.780 --> 00:04:04.120
that makes it easier
for us to pass through.

35
00:04:43.710 --> 00:04:45.960
[ZORO]
Couldn't resist, huh?

36
00:04:45.960 --> 00:04:50.300
You really made
a mess down here.

37
00:04:48.030 --> 00:04:54.870
[Beast Pirates screaming]

38
00:04:51.450 --> 00:04:53.300
[ZORO]
I follow the chaos,
and what do you know,

39
00:04:53.300 --> 00:04:55.810
it leads straight to you.

40
00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:58.120
What the hell, Luffy?

41
00:04:58.120 --> 00:04:58.270
[ZORO]
You're gonna get us killed!

42
00:04:58.270 --> 00:04:59.880
You're gonna get us killed!

43
00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:03.120
You can't do anything
quietly, can you?

44
00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:04.490
Unreal.

45
00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:07.580
Is this how it goes
every time with those fools?

46
00:05:07.580 --> 00:05:10.000
[Killer laughs]

47
00:05:11.260 --> 00:05:15.890
Do you know what they did?

48
00:05:15.890 --> 00:05:17.020
See that soup?

49
00:05:17.020 --> 00:05:19.600
They wasted it all for a laugh.

50
00:05:19.600 --> 00:05:21.130
[ZORO]
Red bean soup?

51
00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:21.310
I had no idea that
food could taste so good! [OTAMA]
I had no idea that
food could taste so good!

52
00:05:21.310 --> 00:05:26.010
[OTAMA]
I had no idea
that food could taste so good!

53
00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:26.780
If that's the case,
then I'll cut them to shreds.

54
00:05:26.780 --> 00:05:30.900
If that's the case,
I'll have to cut them to shreds.

55
00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:39.060
What do we got going on here?

56
00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:46.100
All that for soup?
Any idea why they got so angry?

57
00:05:46.100 --> 00:05:50.610
[KILLER]
That crew is hopeless.
I can't work with them.

58
00:05:51.170 --> 00:05:54.430
Well, crap. Think they're
gonna notice this.

59
00:05:54.430 --> 00:05:56.760
Still, we got all these
guys riled up way before

60
00:05:56.760 --> 00:05:59.060
the final battle's
supposed to start.

61
00:05:59.060 --> 00:06:03.460
Maybe that's true, but it's not
like they know who we are yet.

62
00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:05.920
Well? You satisfied now?

63
00:06:04.270 --> 00:06:05.960
[Beast Pirates chuckling]

64
00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:07.510
Yep.

65
00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:10.300
Then so am I.

66
00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:10.880
[Luffy gasps]

67
00:06:10.880 --> 00:06:12.840
After them!

68
00:06:12.840 --> 00:06:14.180
[chuckles]

69
00:06:17.470 --> 00:06:19.060
What's all that noise?

70
00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:22.190
Don't tell me someone
started a fight.

71
00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:23.150
[Beast Pirate G groans]

72
00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:28.190
Wait a second. Uh-oh.

73
00:06:28.190 --> 00:06:30.320
[Luffy chuckles]

74
00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:31.530
[gasps]

75
00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:40.460
[Luffy laughs]

76
00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:42.540
Stop screwin' around,
we got somethin' goin' down.

77
00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:43.030
Do ya feel my sound?

78
00:06:43.030 --> 00:06:44.280
♪ Yo, yo, yo! ♪

79
00:06:44.280 --> 00:06:46.450
♪ Apoo, Apoo,
tell me what I gotta do. ♪

80
00:06:46.450 --> 00:06:47.390
♪ What are we goin' through? ♪

81
00:06:47.390 --> 00:06:47.660
♪ Lay it on me straight,
now, that's your cue! ♪

82
00:06:47.660 --> 00:06:48.600
♪ Something's really
buggin' you? ♪

83
00:06:48.600 --> 00:06:49.170
it!

84
00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:55.940
[chuckles]

85
00:06:56.890 --> 00:06:58.020
Check it out!

86
00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:00.110
♪ With Udon under
your supervision, ♪

87
00:07:00.110 --> 00:07:03.110
♪ no one escapes your prison. ♪

88
00:07:04.240 --> 00:07:09.490
♪ The rats were locked up tight,
no hope in sight. ♪

89
00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:15.910
♪ Check out that brat
wearing the straw hat! ♪

90
00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:17.540
Huh? Wanna fight?

91
00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:21.000
[APOO]
♪ There's no
forgetting that face, ♪

92
00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:22.500
♪ he musta wrecked the place! ♪

93
00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:26.050
♪ Turned your labor camp
into a damned disgrace! ♪

94
00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:29.510
[QUEEN]
Hm?

95
00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:35.470
The hell?

96
00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:38.940
[Beast Pirates scream]

97
00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:38.440
[grunts]

98
00:07:44.070 --> 00:07:46.860
[Zoro grunts]

99
00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:48.820
[laughs]

100
00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:52.160
♪ Face the facts,
they made a comeback! ♪

101
00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:58.040
[APOO]
♪ Straw Hat Luffy,
kickin' it live. ♪

102
00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:01.420
♪ Pirate Hunter Zoro
in overdrive! ♪

103
00:08:01.420 --> 00:08:03.320
[Luffy chuckles]

104
00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:06.990
So he broke out
of prison after all.

105
00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:06.330
[grunts]

106
00:08:06.330 --> 00:08:08.290
[BABANUKI]
This is the chief warden.

107
00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:10.040
It seems we finally got through.

108
00:08:10.040 --> 00:08:13.750
[BABANUKI]
I just called to
let you know that all is well.

109
00:08:13.750 --> 00:08:17.260
[Luffy grunts]

110
00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:21.650
Before you party, do me a favor!

111
00:08:21.650 --> 00:08:22.200
♪ Catch those suckers,
make it quick, ♪

112
00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:26.870
♪ before they pull
a dirty trick! Ha! ♪

113
00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:28.200
♪ I see, I see. ♪

114
00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:29.950
♪ But if I make them history, ♪

115
00:08:29.950 --> 00:08:32.370
♪ what the hell's
that do for me? ♪

116
00:08:32.370 --> 00:08:34.040
[QUEEN]
Now that you mention it,

117
00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:37.260
there's someone I'm
about to get rid of.

118
00:08:37.260 --> 00:08:40.290
Ah...

119
00:08:43.920 --> 00:08:46.970
[Ulti grunts]

120
00:09:07.290 --> 00:09:09.880
...they're gonna have
a vacant slot in their lineup.

121
00:09:09.880 --> 00:09:14.220
So whoever catches those rats
gets a promotion!

122
00:09:14.220 --> 00:09:19.430
[Beast Pirates cheering]

123
00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:22.370
The Tobi Roppo, huh?

124
00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:25.370
If that doesn't motivate you,
I don't know what will!

125
00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:27.880
[Wolf A growls]

126
00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:31.210
This one is mine!

127
00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:37.380
[Beast Pirates chuckling]

128
00:09:38.940 --> 00:09:41.190
[ZORO]
That must be Kaido's tower!

129
00:09:41.190 --> 00:09:42.360
Don't get stuck fighting.

130
00:09:42.360 --> 00:09:43.530
We need to push through!

131
00:09:43.530 --> 00:09:44.740
Got it!

132
00:09:44.740 --> 00:09:46.780
[grunts]

133
00:09:47.040 --> 00:09:48.830
[chuckles]

134
00:09:48.830 --> 00:09:49.910
[Luffy grunts]

135
00:09:59.130 --> 00:10:01.760
These guys are a little
tougher, aren't they?

136
00:10:01.760 --> 00:10:03.300
They're slowing us down.

137
00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:04.600
Uh-huh.

138
00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:07.930
I think they've all got
Smile Fruit powers. Hey.

139
00:10:12.470 --> 00:10:16.470
[symbol crash]

140
00:10:16.470 --> 00:10:22.100
[drum beats]

141
00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:28.780
You gonna feel my
Fighting Music! Scratch!

142
00:10:28.780 --> 00:10:30.150
Bop!

143
00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:37.950
[Luffy groans]

144
00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:38.950
Luffy!

145
00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:42.580
What the...
Did someone punch me?

146
00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:45.420
[laughs]

147
00:10:45.420 --> 00:10:47.250
Wait. I know that guy.

148
00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:51.550
I think he used to
be Jaggy's ally!

149
00:10:51.550 --> 00:10:52.970
Slash!

150
00:10:52.970 --> 00:10:54.510
[gasps, groans]

151
00:10:55.510 --> 00:10:55.900
[ZORO]
He cut me?

152
00:10:55.900 --> 00:10:56.820
No!

153
00:10:59.890 --> 00:11:01.270
[ZORO]
But he doesn't have a blade

154
00:11:01.270 --> 00:11:04.440
and I couldn't see his
line of attack at all.

155
00:11:05.270 --> 00:11:07.480
[ZORO]
How the hell
does his power work?

156
00:11:07.480 --> 00:11:12.110
[laughs]

157
00:11:12.110 --> 00:11:14.400
Boom!

158
00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:16.410
[Luffy groans]

159
00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:18.930
Luffy!

160
00:11:21.960 --> 00:11:24.500
Hot damn,
you busted their asses!

161
00:11:24.500 --> 00:11:27.710
That was easy!

162
00:11:27.710 --> 00:11:32.630
[chuckles]

163
00:11:32.630 --> 00:11:35.010
This is bad! We gotta get away!

164
00:11:35.010 --> 00:11:36.800
Don't just stand there,
you goons!

165
00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:40.180
You got 'em on the ropes,
now hurry and finish the job!

166
00:11:40.180 --> 00:11:43.600
You wanna be a part of
the Tobi Roppo or not?

167
00:11:42.910 --> 00:11:45.660
[Haccha chuckles]

168
00:11:43.640 --> 00:11:46.520
Get to work!

169
00:11:46.520 --> 00:11:50.230
[ZORO]
We can't take
a beating here. Not like this.

170
00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:52.030
[Both gasp]

171
00:11:50.280 --> 00:11:51.610
[Beast Pirate P grunts]

172
00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:53.900
[Zoro grunts]

173
00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:56.660
[ZORO]
We need every ounce
of strength for Kaido!

174
00:11:56.660 --> 00:12:00.240
They've got us outnumbered,
but that's not all.

175
00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:01.870
They're strong, too.

176
00:12:01.870 --> 00:12:03.700
I got you now!

177
00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:08.420
[roars]

178
00:12:09.840 --> 00:12:13.300
I'm good now.
Sorry 'bout that, Zoro.

179
00:12:13.300 --> 00:12:14.700
You better be.

180
00:12:14.700 --> 00:12:17.620
There's no point in wearing
these anymore, right?

181
00:12:17.620 --> 00:12:21.280
I guess not. They're too
constricting anyway.

182
00:12:21.280 --> 00:12:25.410
All right, then. [grunts]

183
00:12:25.410 --> 00:12:26.830
[LUFFY]
No holding back!

184
00:12:26.830 --> 00:12:28.790
We gotta break through quick!

185
00:12:28.790 --> 00:12:31.170
You got it!

186
00:12:30.740 --> 00:12:33.040
[drum beating]

187
00:12:31.210 --> 00:12:32.760
[APOO]
Ya think it's that easy?

188
00:12:32.760 --> 00:12:35.790
[Beast Pirates cackle] As long as you're in my range,
I can mess you up!

189
00:12:35.790 --> 00:12:36.010
[gasps]
So how do we fight that?

190
00:12:36.010 --> 00:12:37.050
Check it out!

191
00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:44.050
Scratch!

192
00:12:44.050 --> 00:12:46.920
[groans]

193
00:12:46.920 --> 00:12:51.090
[symbol crashing]

194
00:13:14.560 --> 00:13:19.200
So much suffering
and I owe it all to you!

195
00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:26.240
[KID]
I'll see you in hell, Apoo!

196
00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:28.040
Aw, hell no!

197
00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:33.380
[cackling]

198
00:13:29.510 --> 00:13:34.480
[Kid grunts]

199
00:13:32.560 --> 00:13:34.480
[cackles]

200
00:13:33.420 --> 00:13:34.480
[gasps]

201
00:13:34.480 --> 00:13:38.560
There's thousands of these guys,
even tougher ones might show up!

202
00:13:38.560 --> 00:13:40.150
Yeah! I know!

203
00:13:44.490 --> 00:13:47.740
[gasps]

204
00:13:47.740 --> 00:13:48.950
[KID]
Why're you here?

205
00:13:51.710 --> 00:13:56.120
Ah, it's Jaggy! That idiot!

206
00:13:56.120 --> 00:13:59.410
Let's hurry! This way!

207
00:13:59.410 --> 00:14:00.790
No, Apoo!

208
00:14:00.790 --> 00:14:03.420
Hey! Wait a second.
Who is that guy?

209
00:14:03.420 --> 00:14:09.840
[yelling]

210
00:14:11.930 --> 00:14:13.310
Got it!

211
00:14:15.900 --> 00:14:19.030
What?!

212
00:14:19.030 --> 00:14:23.950
Aw, hell no! Seriously?

213
00:14:26.280 --> 00:14:30.540
[QUEEN]
What the shit is
Captain Kid doing here?!

214
00:14:35.120 --> 00:14:37.000
[QUEEN]
Like Straw Hat
wasn't bad enough already!

215
00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:40.050
What happened
in Udon, Babanuki?!

216
00:14:41.160 --> 00:14:43.040
How did you
screw this up so bad?

217
00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:45.760
You're making me look stupid!

218
00:14:45.760 --> 00:14:47.090
[KILLER]
Huh?

219
00:14:50.970 --> 00:14:51.970
You got it?

220
00:14:51.970 --> 00:14:56.390
[panting]

221
00:14:53.440 --> 00:14:54.560
[gasps]

222
00:14:57.110 --> 00:14:58.940
[KID]
You just couldn't wait to form

223
00:14:58.940 --> 00:15:01.990
that alliance with us,
could you?

224
00:15:01.990 --> 00:15:05.160
[Kid grunts]

225
00:15:03.100 --> 00:15:06.190
[growls]
I made a mistake.

226
00:15:03.780 --> 00:15:05.160
[groans]

227
00:15:05.160 --> 00:15:09.290
I shouldn't have
been so trusting.

228
00:15:10.740 --> 00:15:12.200
I should have known
that you were

229
00:15:12.200 --> 00:15:14.620
working as an
informant for Kaido!

230
00:15:14.620 --> 00:15:15.880
He was ready for us
because he knew

231
00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:16.670
And you were the one
responsible for that!

232
00:15:16.670 --> 00:15:18.340
every move we'd make!

233
00:15:22.970 --> 00:15:25.970
[yells]

234
00:15:25.970 --> 00:15:28.430
You were screwed
from the start, sucker.

235
00:15:28.430 --> 00:15:29.550
Oh yeah?

236
00:15:29.550 --> 00:15:31.850
You thought our alliance
was that strong?

237
00:15:31.850 --> 00:15:35.350
Strong enough to take on one of
the Four Emperors that easy?

238
00:15:35.350 --> 00:15:37.140
Get real, you moron!

239
00:15:39.520 --> 00:15:42.190
[APOO]
Pirate Alliances are
sketchy to begin with.

240
00:15:42.190 --> 00:15:45.570
You're seriously out here
expecting a happy ending, huh?

241
00:15:45.570 --> 00:15:47.360
Well, Scratch!

242
00:15:47.360 --> 00:15:49.660
Slash!

243
00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:51.680
<b>SLASH</b>

244
00:15:52.360 --> 00:15:54.320
[KILLER]
Huh?

245
00:15:54.320 --> 00:16:02.260
[Kid groans]

246
00:15:54.830 --> 00:15:59.750
[Apoo laughs]

247
00:16:02.260 --> 00:16:02.300
Though, I gotta admit,
you're hard to kill.

248
00:16:02.300 --> 00:16:05.890
I gotta admit, for such a chump,
you're hard to kill.

249
00:16:05.890 --> 00:16:09.520
For all the good it does ya.

250
00:16:09.520 --> 00:16:11.990
You're a scumbag.

251
00:16:11.990 --> 00:16:12.560
Queen,

252
00:16:12.560 --> 00:16:15.020
we're having a tough
time over here.

253
00:16:15.890 --> 00:16:17.940
I don't know if we can
catch these guys alive.

254
00:16:17.940 --> 00:16:20.190
They're way too slippery!

255
00:16:20.860 --> 00:16:23.650
Then they'll have to die.

256
00:16:23.650 --> 00:16:30.530
[Beast Pirates yell]

257
00:16:23.650 --> 00:16:26.240
[gasps]

258
00:16:28.150 --> 00:16:30.900
[Beast Pirates scream]

259
00:16:30.900 --> 00:16:34.410
[ZORO]
Yeah, he's got some range.

260
00:16:34.410 --> 00:16:35.200
Heh.

261
