275
00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:31.300
[Haccha chuckles]

276
00:17:29.790 --> 00:17:33.140
[Both gasp]

277
00:17:38.720 --> 00:17:40.550
[Beast Pirates gasp]

278
00:17:40.550 --> 00:17:41.930
[Beast Pirate M gasps]

279
00:17:42.930 --> 00:17:44.060
[KILLER]
All right, well,

280
00:17:44.060 --> 00:17:47.270
[Beast Pirates gasp]

281
00:17:47.270 --> 00:17:53.480
[hiccups, laughs]

282
00:17:51.190 --> 00:17:52.860
[grunts]

283
00:17:53.520 --> 00:17:54.980
