290
00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:15.210
[Both gasp]

291
00:18:15.210 --> 00:18:16.840
[Haccha grunts]

292
00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:30.170
<b>Haccha
One of the Numbers</b>

293
00:18:32.330 --> 00:18:34.370
[grunts]

294
00:18:34.370 --> 00:18:40.750
[cackles]

295
00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:42.450
Sure would be a shame
if someone shot you in the back!

296
00:18:42.450 --> 00:18:46.160
Sure would be a shame if
someone shot you in the back!

297
00:18:47.910 --> 00:18:49.040
[KID]
Hm?

298
00:18:50.960 --> 00:18:53.420
[gasps]

299
00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:53.420
