has yet to notice our presence.

345
00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:14.670
Therefore, we should
split in two yet again!

346
00:21:14.670 --> 00:21:16.290
[Samurai gasp]

347
00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:18.710
The first group will sneak in
from the side of the Skull Dome

348
00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:30.890
<b>Present

Location</b>

349
00:21:18.710 --> 00:21:20.500
and wait inside
for the time being.

350
00:21:20.500 --> 00:21:21.710
Thanks to our disguises,

351
00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:24.010
you should be able to
blend in quite easily.

352
00:21:23.300 --> 00:21:24.880
[Samurai gasp]

353
00:21:24.050 --> 00:21:25.380
Meanwhile, the second group will

354
00:21:25.380 --> 00:21:27.720
sneak in from the back
entrance of the castle.

355
00:21:27.720 --> 00:21:31.430
Once we're both in position,
we can launch a pincer attack.

356
00:21:31.430 --> 00:21:33.680
There's a lot riding on this.

357
00:21:33.680 --> 00:21:39.150
I wonder if Momo's
there with Orochi.

358
00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:41.440
[NARRATOR]
Thus, after a few alterations,

359
00:21:41.440 --> 00:21:44.820
