to progress smoothly.

360
00:21:47.680 --> 00:21:50.640
[Kin'emon gasps]
One moment!

361
00:21:50.640 --> 00:21:52.100
[NARRATOR]
Suddenly, they encounter

362
00:21:52.100 --> 00:21:55.680
an unexpected complication.

363
00:21:55.680 --> 00:21:57.100
What a pity.

364
00:21:57.100 --> 00:21:59.980
The information on the
blueprints was out of date.

365
00:21:59.980 --> 00:22:01.650
The base was expanded.

366
00:22:01.650 --> 00:22:03.280
This part is new.

367
00:22:02.590 --> 00:22:08.430
Building: "Sweet Entanglement"

368
00:22:03.280 --> 00:22:06.280
But if 2,000 soldiers
try to cross that bridge,

369
00:22:06.280 --> 00:22:08.950
