Look! Look! Look!

373
00:22:18.100 --> 00:22:18.610
It's a pleasure hall,
just for me! [laughs]

374
00:22:18.610 --> 00:22:22.860
It's a pleasure hall,
just for me!

375
00:22:22.860 --> 00:22:25.200
