It was indeed a pleasure hall.

376
00:22:25.200 --> 00:22:30.660
Owned by Black Maria,
one of the Tobi Roppo.

377
00:22:31.500 --> 00:22:36.320
[gasps]
My lovely lady sensor
is going crazy!

378
00:22:36.320 --> 00:22:37.630
