Can you let us through?

379
00:22:37.630 --> 00:22:40.200
No! Sanji!

380
00:22:42.290 --> 00:22:44.400
What are we gonna do?

381
00:22:45.750 --> 00:22:46.360
we gonna do?

382
00:22:46.360 --> 00:22:48.410
Let me take a small group
and sneak in alone.

383
00:22:48.410 --> 00:22:48.820
me!

384
00:22:48.820 --> 00:22:50.160
We'll rescue Lord Momonosuke

385
00:22:50.160 --> 00:22:52.450
