about him, aren't you?

388
00:22:55.700 --> 00:22:56.830
That's fine!

389
00:22:57.300 --> 00:22:59.390
[BEAST PIRATES]
No way!

390
00:22:59.390 --> 00:23:00.720
[gasps]

391
00:23:03.250 --> 00:23:04.630
