394
00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:11.930
You-teia just focus on
beating Kaido, okay?

395
00:23:11.930 --> 00:23:15.600
Madam Nami!
Madam Carrot! Shinobu!

396
00:23:15.600 --> 00:23:18.310
[All chuckle]

397
00:23:18.310 --> 00:23:19.680
I'm grateful!

398
00:23:19.680 --> 00:23:23.230
Honestly, the matter's been
weighing heavy on me.

399
00:23:23.230 --> 00:23:25.190
Stay safe.

400
00:23:27.880 --> 00:23:31.510
[gasps]
Someone's come out
of the pleasure hall!

401
00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:34.550
[gasps]
Sir Sanji!

402
00:23:34.550 --> 00:23:35.100
Sir

403
