[USOPP]
I'm guessing he
couldn't find any ladies.

404
00:23:41.930 --> 00:23:43.520
[NARRATOR]
After hearing
the commotion that

405
00:23:43.520 --> 00:23:45.190
Luffy and the others caused,

406
00:23:45.190 --> 00:23:47.270
almost all of Kaido's
subordinates went

407
00:23:47.270 --> 00:23:50.570
