hall to investigate.

408
00:23:52.840 --> 00:23:55.260
[BEAST PIRATE U]
Invaders! Capture them!

409
00:23:55.260 --> 00:23:57.550
[BEAST PIRATE V]
Kill them if you have to!

410
00:23:57.550 --> 00:24:02.640
[Luffy yells]

411
00:24:02.640 --> 00:24:09.320
[Beast Pirates screaming]

412
00:24:10.360 --> 00:24:14.700
It's Killer!

413
00:24:14.700 --> 00:24:17.700
Hey! Hey! Hey!

414
00:24:16.090 --> 00:24:19.180
[LAUGHING]

415
00:24:17.740 --> 00:24:19.870
Step up, step up, chumps.

416
00:24:19.870 --> 00:24:21.830
The guy's not that strong!

417
00:24:21.830 --> 00:24:25.330
What is taking so long? [laughs]

418
00:24:25.330 --> 00:24:27.500
Don't you know the story?

419
00:24:27.500 --> 00:24:29.920
Killer ate a defective
SMILE fruit

420
00:24:29.440 --> 00:24:30.700
[Killer coughs]

421
00:24:29.960 --> 00:24:31.960
