422
00:24:31.960 --> 00:24:34.880
He ain't got no power!

423
00:24:34.880 --> 00:24:36.400
[Apoo chuckles] [Orochi chuckles] [OROCHI CHUCKLES]

424
00:24:36.400 --> 00:24:36.410
Let's make a deal

425
00:24:36.410 --> 00:24:38.450
Let's make a deal.

426
00:24:38.450 --> 00:24:38.490
If you eat this little fruit,

427
00:24:38.490 --> 00:24:39.990
If you eat this little fruit

428
00:24:39.990 --> 00:24:40.040
I'll give you a chance
to save your captain

429
00:24:40.040 --> 00:24:42.950
I'll give you a chance
to save your captain!

430
00:24:42.950 --> 00:24:49.590
[Killer panting]

431
00:24:49.590 --> 00:24:52.720
[Orochi chuckles]

432
00:24:50.040 --> 00:24:53.000
[CHUCKLES]

433
00:24:55.530 --> 00:24:58.820
[Beast Pirates scream]

434
00:25:02.370 --> 00:25:02.800
If any bastard laughs at you,

435
00:25:02.800 --> 00:25:04.290
[KID]
If any bastard laughs at you

436
00:25:04.290 --> 00:25:04.670
I'll send them straight
to hell, understand?

437
00:25:04.670 --> 00:25:08.080
I'll send them straight
to hell, understand

438
00:25:08.080 --> 00:25:09.250
[KILLER]
All right.

439
00:25:09.510 --> 00:25:12.470
[Killer laughs]

440
00:25:13.880 --> 00:25:16.550
Stop beating up dudes
and move it!

441
00:25:20.950 --> 00:25:23.530
So they broke out
of the prison in Udon.

442
00:25:23.530 --> 00:25:24.990
[SUBORDINATE A]
Should we catch them?

443
00:25:24.990 --> 00:25:26.790
We'll be rewarded!

444
00:25:26.790 --> 00:25:30.540
Not worth it.
They're just a couple of rats.

445
00:25:30.540 --> 00:25:34.000
Put your efforts into
finding Yamato instead.

446
00:25:34.000 --> 00:25:37.260
That's Kaido's biggest
concern right now.

447
00:25:37.260 --> 00:25:39.800
And don't let Sasaki
find him first!

448
00:25:39.800 --> 00:25:41.760
[SUBORDINATE A]
Yes, sir!

449
00:25:44.510 --> 00:25:47.770
All right, time to clean up,
what's takin' so long?

450
00:25:47.400 --> 00:25:50.200
Put 'em in a grave six feet below!

451
00:25:47.770 --> 00:25:51.020
Knock 'em on their asses,
they ain't even that strong!

452
00:25:52.190 --> 00:25:58.490
Damn it. Queen, what the hell
you trying to pull?

453
00:26:00.210 --> 00:26:04.590
You want someone dead, huh?

454
00:26:04.590 --> 00:26:07.780
Well, turns out I do, too.

455
00:26:07.780 --> 00:26:08.440
All right!

456
00:26:08.440 --> 00:26:09.200
[KIN'EMON]
All right.
No women in the pleasure hall

457
00:26:09.200 --> 00:26:10.320
No women in the pleasure hall
means no men, either.

458
00:26:10.320 --> 00:26:11.750
means no men, either.

459
00:26:11.750 --> 00:26:12.280
It is now safe
to cross the bridge!

460
00:26:12.280 --> 00:26:14.820
It is now safe to
cross the bridge!

461
00:26:14.820 --> 00:26:16.120
[Shishilian grunts]

462
00:26:16.120 --> 00:26:18.490
Infiltration team,
I wish you the best of luck!

463
00:26:18.490 --> 00:26:21.450
[all cheer]

464
00:26:21.450 --> 00:26:24.370
Nice. That's the spirit, guys!

465
00:26:24.370 --> 00:26:26.080
[KIN'EMON]
My group, follow me!

466
00:26:26.080 --> 00:26:27.880
[SAMURAI]
Yes, sir!

467
00:26:29.550 --> 00:26:32.010
[CHOPPER]
Sniper Usopp AKA Driver Usopp,

468
00:26:32.010 --> 00:26:33.590
