with the infantry!

471
00:26:38.640 --> 00:26:40.850
10-4, Tank Commander
Chopper, good buddy!

472
00:26:40.850 --> 00:26:42.640
Proceeding forward!

473
00:26:42.640 --> 00:26:45.230
With maximum slowness.

474
00:26:48.320 --> 00:26:50.610
Keep an eye on the windows
of the pleasure hall!

475
00:26:50.610 --> 00:26:52.990
There may be a few
people lingering inside!

476
00:26:52.990 --> 00:26:54.780
I'll be vigilant!

477
00:26:56.320 --> 00:26:59.410
[KIN'EMON]
If you spy a shadow,
that's bad news!

478
00:26:59.410 --> 00:27:00.620
[SHISHILIAN]
Kin'emon.

479
00:27:00.620 --> 00:27:03.290
[BIG MOM]
It's awfully noisy out there.

480
00:27:04.470 --> 00:27:08.100
[Kin'emon gasps]
Move quickly!
Dive into the water!

481
00:27:37.390 --> 00:27:42.470
