Outside

of Wano</b>

482
00:27:44.060 --> 00:27:45.940
Come on. We're almost there!

483
00:27:45.940 --> 00:27:50.900
[Octopus A grunts]

484
00:27:48.990 --> 00:27:50.900
[Big Mom Pirates cheer]

485
00:27:50.900 --> 00:27:54.780
Yes! Keep climbing!

486
00:27:55.690 --> 00:27:57.900
