getting roped into.

490
00:28:05.870 --> 00:28:08.370
Oh, it's lickity-loony,
for sure!

491
00:28:08.370 --> 00:28:10.330
I don't know what
Mama's thinking!

492
00:28:10.330 --> 00:28:12.710
She made the call,
so deal with it.

493
00:28:12.710 --> 00:28:14.630
Forget about the damn alliance.

494
00:28:14.630 --> 00:28:17.800
That is not the reason
we came to Wano, remember?

495
00:28:17.800 --> 00:28:18.880
He's right.

496
00:28:18.880 --> 00:28:20.380
Straw Hat made a fool of Mama

497
00:28:20.380 --> 00:28:23.260
and we can't rest till we've
restored our family's honor!

498
00:28:23.260 --> 00:28:25.720
We'll serve up that bastard's
head on a silver platter.

499
00:28:25.720 --> 00:28:29.060
[FLAMPE]
That's so savage.
Don't you think?

500
00:28:29.060 --> 00:28:30.980
Well, I've got a better plan!

501
00:28:30.980 --> 00:28:35.690
I'm gonna make Kaido
love me and pamper me!

502
00:28:35.690 --> 00:28:37.690
Shut the hell up, Flampe!

503
00:28:37.690 --> 00:28:39.570
[PEROSPERO]
We've arrived at last!

504
00:28:39.570 --> 00:28:41.150
The Land of Wano!

505
00:28:41.150 --> 00:28:43.660
We don't know what's
waiting for us out there.

506
00:28:43.660 --> 00:28:46.700
Weapons ready!

507
00:28:46.700 --> 00:28:48.200
They wouldn't dare.

508
00:28:48.200 --> 00:28:52.960
They are quite audacious.
Who knows what King might do.

509
00:28:54.500 --> 00:28:55.580
He came back!

510
00:28:55.580 --> 00:28:58.090
You're right! That scoundrel!

511
00:28:58.090 --> 00:29:01.510
And at the exact same spot, too!

512
00:29:01.510 --> 00:29:04.930
No, wait.

513
00:29:04.640 --> 00:29:07.060
<b>Marco "the Phoenix"
Former First Division Commander
of the Whitebeard Pirates</b>

514
00:29:04.930 --> 00:29:06.930
[PEROSPERO]
That's Marco!

515
00:29:06.930 --> 00:29:09.600
Huh! I doubt they're
here for sightseeing,

516
00:29:09.600 --> 00:29:13.020
so it looks like the alliance
thing is true after all.

517
00:29:13.020 --> 00:29:15.190
Can't have that, now can we?

518
00:29:18.080 --> 00:29:19.500
[Basskarte grunts]

519
00:29:26.860 --> 00:29:28.460
right.

520
00:29:28.460 --> 00:29:33.510
Back down you go! Phoenix Brand!

521
00:29:33.510 --> 00:29:37.810
Not today, you foolish bird!

522
00:29:37.810 --> 00:29:41.730
[Marco grunts]

523
00:29:41.730 --> 00:29:43.640
Are you kidding me?!

524
00:29:43.640 --> 00:29:45.150
[SMOOTHIE, DAIFUKU]
– Oh no!
– Oh no!

525
00:29:49.820 --> 00:29:53.320
Looks like our crew's
falling down again!

526
00:29:53.320 --> 00:29:57.030
Wano may be a different place
by the time you make it back.

527
00:29:57.030 --> 00:30:00.160
Things have been moving
and shaking around here lately!

528
00:30:02.960 --> 00:30:06.460
[CAT VIPER]
Got ships falling
from the sky today, do we?

529
00:30:06.460 --> 00:30:07.670
Look up there.

530
00:30:08.800 --> 00:30:09.840
Ah?

531
00:30:09.840 --> 00:30:10.810
Ah!

532
00:30:10.810 --> 00:30:11.880
It's been so long.

533
00:30:11.880 --> 00:30:13.100
[IZO]
It's been

534
00:30:13.100 --> 00:30:16.060
I haven't seen you
since the war.
